WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.812
This query groups order rows by product The output
grain changes

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:12.338
from one order row to one product That grain change
is important in PostgreSQL

00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:18.139
and in Spark In Spark GROUP BY can also create a
shuffle because rows

00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:21.349
with the same product may need to be brought
together across workers
